+# Cache eviction policy
+
+No single current decision on the cache eviction policy is recorded. The project's records hold two entries that disagree, and neither is marked as replacing the other: one names an LFU cache, the other names an LRU cache with a 300-second TTL. Until the project confirms which one stands, this document states no eviction policy or TTL value.
